### GET /category-groups — should return seeded groups with statement_type joined
GET http://localhost:8080/category-groups

###

### GET /expense-categories — should return seeded categories with group_name
GET http://localhost:8080/expense-categories

###

### POST /journal-entries — valid input, expect 201 + joined response
POST http://localhost:8080/journal-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_date": "2025-05-05",
  "item": "コンビニランチ",
  "amount": 850,
  "category_id": 1,
  "is_excluded": false,
  "note": "昼飯"
}

###

